# Application data (uploads, sqlite db, embedded qdrant, model cache)
#
# These patterns are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. A bare `data/`
# or `storage/` matches a directory of that name at *any* depth, which
# silently excluded `backend/app/services/storage/` — real source code — from
# the repository. A fresh clone then failed on import while the original
# working copy kept running, which is close to undiagnosable.
/data/
/backend/data/
/frontend/data/
*.db
*.sqlite3
.models/

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
